{
  "id": "p10",
  "title": "The Autumn Tour",
  "titleZh": "秋日旅行团",
  "topic": "旅行",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "In early autumn, a small tourist bus waits quietly outside.",
        "zh": "初秋时，一辆小小的旅游巴士静静地停在外面。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My tour manager knows her duty very well.",
        "zh": "我的旅游经理非常清楚自己的职责。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Thirty people fill every single soft front seat today.",
        "zh": "今天三十个人坐满了每一个柔软的前排座位。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We choose a new route and a clear, firm, fair choice.",
        "zh": "我们选了一条新路线，做了一个明确、坚定又公平的选择。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then one careful step lowers the risk again today.",
        "zh": "于是，一个谨慎的步子今天再次降低了风险。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The plain fact gives us a good and very simple reason.",
        "zh": "这个简单的事实给了我们一个很好也很简单的理由。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A hard question waits quietly for a calm answer.",
        "zh": "一个难题静静地等着一个平静的答案。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The road is difficult and the cold, wet weather bad.",
        "zh": "路很难走，天气又冷又湿，情况很糟。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We receive a helpful suggestion from a kind local farmer today.",
        "zh": "今天一位好心的当地农民给了我们一个有用的建议。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The rough road condition improves before warm, bright noon each day.",
        "zh": "这条崎岖的路况每天在温暖明亮的正午前都有改善。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A safe vehicle waits near the old stone front gate.",
        "zh": "一辆安全的车停在古老的石砌前门附近。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later, at this height, the long climb feels easy and short.",
        "zh": "后来，在这个高度，这段长长的攀爬显得轻松又短暂。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A deep green valley touches the low grey cloud.",
        "zh": "一道深绿色的山谷碰着低低的灰云。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A brown cow licks a block of white kitchen salt.",
        "zh": "一头棕色的奶牛舔着一块白色的食盐。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A lucky guest tastes the local fish dish first.",
        "zh": "一位幸运的客人第一个尝到了当地的鱼菜。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My soft music helps the young girl sing again so well.",
        "zh": "我轻柔的音乐让那个年轻女孩又能唱得那么好。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her magic show marks a fine, proud, happy debut today.",
        "zh": "今天她的魔术表演标志着一个出色而自豪的初次登台。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The cultural event gives her a new, happy, useful role.",
        "zh": "这场文化活动给了她一个新的、快乐又有用的角色。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young calf is born beside a small red rubber ball.",
        "zh": "一头小牛犊出生在一个小小的红色橡皮球旁边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My friend and I compare the two routes for one clear advantage.",
        "zh": "我和朋友比较了两条路线，为了一个明显的优势。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A big wooden sign stands beside the narrow road.",
        "zh": "一块大木牌立在狭窄的路边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The old engine never turns off on this steep, muddy hill.",
        "zh": "在这座陡峭泥泞的山上，旧发动机从不熄火。"
      },
      {
        "en": "All of these front seats face the wide, green valley.",
        "zh": "所有这些前排座位都朝着宽阔的绿色山谷。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the break, we find a small cafe with warm, fresh soup.",
        "zh": "休息时，我们找到一家小咖啡馆，里面有热腾腾的新鲜汤。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A great will keeps the whole happy group together.",
        "zh": "一种强大的意志让整个快乐的团队团结在一起。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We stop twice before the twelfth long green mile.",
        "zh": "在第十二个长长的绿色英里之前，我们停了两次。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Take care, or the bike may hurt someone today.",
        "zh": "小心点，否则自行车今天可能会伤到人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They wear warm winter coats and keep a double, happy secret together.",
        "zh": "他们穿着暖和的冬衣，一起守着一个双重的秘密。"
      }
    ]
  ],
